# MINIX 1.1 source code
Repo includes the MINIX 1.1 source code.

## TL;DR
- Run `make dev86` to setup the 8088 cross-compile toolchain.
- Build MINIX libc for the host with `make libc`.
- Build MINIX with `make minix`.
- Build both libc and MINIX with `make`.

